---
description: Tailwind v4 CSS-first token policy.
globs:
  - "src/styles/globals.css"
  - "src/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}"
  - "tailwind.config.ts"
alwaysApply: true
---

- Tailwind v4 tokens are defined in `@theme` within `src/styles/globals.css`.
- Keep `tailwind.config.ts` minimal; do not reintroduce `theme.extend` token definitions already present in `@theme`.
- Add/modify tokens in `@theme` first, then use matching utility classes in components.
- Preserve existing utility semantics and responsive behavior; avoid utility renames that cause visual drift.
- Do not change business logic while performing style/token migrations.
